From 041e92a8a403c627e0ac3e087952aab94ba0776c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@st.com>
Date: Wed, 27 May 2026 15:58:41 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 489/572] fix(build): move SMC_PCI_SUPPORT flag management to
 Makefile

The flag SMC_PCI_SUPPORT is set to 0 in make_helpers/defaults.mk. It can
then be defined in Makefile.
This will avoid warning for platforms not using SMC_PCI_SUPPORT with
-Wundef.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/arm-trusted-firmware.git 0894d35c1fed5fefac87bb90a9bfc2653e1f66bf fix(build): move SMC_PCI_SUPPORT flag management to Makefile]
Change-Id: I142fd03ce3f01d098a2af93f63e7a3c322c71bdd
Signed-off-by: Yann Gautier <yann.gautier@st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/tf-a/+/572129
Reviewed-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Tested-by: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Domain-Review: Yann GAUTIER <yann.gautier@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-by: Maxime MERE <maxime.mere@foss.st.com>
---
 Makefile | 2 ++
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Makefile b/Makefile
index 28234b988a..6db34888df 100644
--- a/Makefile
+++ b/Makefile
@@ -654,6 +654,7 @@ $(eval $(call assert_booleans,\
 	HOB_LIST \
 	LFA_SUPPORT \
 	SDEI_SUPPORT \
+	SMC_PCI_SUPPORT \
 )))
 
 # Numeric_Flags
@@ -912,6 +913,7 @@ $(eval $(call add_defines,\
 	LFA_SUPPORT \
 	SDEI_SUPPORT \
 	USE_GIC_DRIVER \
+	SMC_PCI_SUPPORT \
 )))
 
 ifeq (${PLATFORM_REPORT_CTX_MEM_USE}, 1)
